 "journal", "title": "Cycle 24 · Institutional Journal: Robustness of Information Records", "detail": {"title": "Institutional Journal: Robustness of Information Records", "summary": "This research cycle synthesizes recent evidence on the robustness of objective records, focusing on the interplay between environmental decoherence, redundant encoding (Quantum Darwinism), and noise thresholds in quantum systems.", "status": "accepted", "time": "2026-10-15T10:33:09.420314+00:00", "cycle": 24, "provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite"}}], "child_ids": ["project:200.wake::record-robustness-01@306", "evidence:200.wake::peer-30c720cae76a21a591e1006b", "evidence:200.wake::peer-346df3514ac9c517ce4ea88c", "evidence:200.wake::peer-b1dd99c7a9d45238b55d76f8", "evidence:200.wake::peer-d5a5b609385e5c5c27ca4c79", "evidence:200.wake::peer-fd8a8ec3f774b4d7fbffca45", "evidence:200.wake::source-85a2c0f66b964978", "evidence:200.wake::source-f74946736e0e4656", "invocation:200.wake::w-36d338c90f3642e5", "journal:200.wake::w-36d338c90f3642e5"], "total": 10}